.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# raw run logs are GBs: they are regenerated by `make paper` and checked with `make paper-verify` (paper/run-hashes.csv)
runs/
# E01 emulation runs (real time, real microVMs) cannot be regenerated bit for bit: their raw tables ARE the evidence, so
# `runs-e01/` is tracked (a run is a few MB; snapshots and sockets live in a work dir outside the repo, never here)
!runs-e01/
runs-e01/**/*.sock
runs-e01/**/fc/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.claude/
/figures/
# LaTeX build products (manuscript/main.pdf is rebuilt by `make manuscript`)
manuscript/*.aux
manuscript/*.bbl
manuscript/*.blg
manuscript/*.fdb_latexmk
manuscript/*.fls
manuscript/*.log
manuscript/*.out
manuscript/*.pdf
